---
// Testimonials — 3 early adopter quotes (placeholders until real)
---

<section
  id="testimonials"
  class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50"
  aria-labelledby="testimonials-heading"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 max-w-6xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2
        id="testimonials-heading"
        class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-900 leading-snug"
      >
        Built for developers, trusted by teams
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Early adopters are shipping AI features faster with MekongMind.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <figure class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm">
        <blockquote class="text-base text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">
          "We replaced 5 separate tools (memory, task mgmt, agent orchestration, billing, monitoring) with one MCP server. Setup took 10 minutes."
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-sky-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="text-base font-semibold text-sky-700">TK</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Indie Dev, SEA</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-slate-600">Early adopter since v0.1</div>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm">
        <blockquote class="text-base text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">
          "MCP tools + Polar billing in one package means no more stitching together Stripe, Redis, and custom API routes. Just works."
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-sky-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="text-base font-semibold text-sky-700">AL</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Startup Founder, VN</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-slate-600">Using Pro plan</div>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm">
        <blockquote class="text-base text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">
          "The plan store's goal decomposition feature saves my team hours every week. Just describe what you want and it breaks it into tasks automatically."
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-sky-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="text-base font-semibold text-sky-700">MN</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Tech Lead, SG</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-slate-600">Enterprise plan</div>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
